# Analysis folder: version the scripts and write-ups only.  Everything the
# scripts compute (results, logs, figures, arrays, built viewers) is
# regenerated by re-running them, so it stays out of git.
*
!*/
!*.py
!*.md
!.gitignore
# hand-written page templates read by oct22/build_all.py and build_v2.py
!oct22/mound_v*_template.html
